<title>NEW ZEALAND: W&amp;K issues shares to NZ Rural Prop s/hrs.</title>
<headline>W&amp;K issues shares to NZ Rural Prop s/hrs.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Williams and Kettle on Thursday advised that the issue of Williams and Kettle shares to to shareholders of New Zealand Rural Properties, in accordance with the takeover offer dated August 1, 1996, had been completed.</p>
<p>A total of 6,270,005 fully paid shares in Williams and Kettle have been issued. The total number of shares of that class on issue is 14,677,570.</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
